    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Species Feats\">Species Feats</a></i></p><p>You can sense the presence of danger naturally, giving you and edge even when you fail to spot trouble the first time.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Zabrak\" title=\"Zabrak\">Zabrak</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> Whenever you reroll a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> check and take the second result, if your second result is lower than your first result, you gain a temporary <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a>. This <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> can be spent only to add to the result of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> check, and if it is not spent before the end of the encounter, it is lost.</p>",
